# Kraven's Last Hunt: I - Bot1 mills a Hill Giant, a Grizzly Bears and three Forests, so the Saga deals 3 to Bot2's Alpine Grizzly (4/2), which dies. II - target
# creature you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn: Bot1's Memnite is a 3/3, attacks, and Bot2 is on 17; Bot2's creature is no legal
# target (Memnite is the only one, so it is chosen), and at the end of turn Memnite is a 1/1 again. III - return target creature card from
# your graveyard to your hand: a Forest and Bot2's Alpine Grizzly in its graveyard are refused; the Hill Giant goes to Bot1's hand; the Saga is then sacrificed.

